11. Petitioner also got examined PW2 Sh. Rohit Kumar @ Manoranjan, who deposed inter alia that Rahul was his neighbour since 10 years; that the accident took place on the night of Diwali around 1 or 2 AM; that he was travelling in different car and they were going to Akash Vihar near Ranhola;
that he and Rahul did not meet before accident on that day; that Rahul was travelling with Dheeraj and his car met with an accident; that at the time of accident, Dheeraj was driving the car; that he alongwith other friends were going through the same road and were ahead of Rahul's car; that he reached the accident place in about 10 to 15 minutes and saw turned down car at Bakkarwala Mor;
that Dheeraj was lying unconscious on the road; that Rahul was lying at the back side of the accident car on the road; that all the doors of the concerned vehicle were blocked; that as per the condition/damaged vehicle, driver of the vehicle might be over speeding and that they took Rahul and Dheeraj to Rathi Hospital and Rahul was declared brought dead by the doctors after reaching hospital.
